title The ball hits an arm
intro Red is kicking the ball toward you.
flip vertical

setup
  lineup 7v7
  player R-CM at 45, 30
  player B-CB at 30, 30
  ball with R-CM

step
  caption Red passes toward your defender.

step
  caption Blue sticks an arm out and stops it.
  ball to 31, 30
  no-hands B-CB
  label B-CB Arm
  arrow from R-CM to ball
  banner Handball
  duration 1200

question
  prompt Is that allowed?
  answer No
  wrong Yes
  wrong Only in your own half
  wrong Only near your goal
  correct Arms are not allowed.
  why Only the goalie may use hands, and only inside their own box. Everyone else plays it with feet, legs, chest, or head.

question
  prompt What does Red get?
  answer A free kick
  wrong A penalty kick
  wrong A throw-in
  wrong A goal kick
  correct A free kick.
  why The arm was outside your big box, so Red just gets a free kick there.
